{
  "version": "2.0",
  "proto": 2,
  "transport": "nakama-json",
  "note": "对局协议 v2（平台/内容分离整改 M1）。相对 1.0 的增量：删除 attack（普攻=技能 Def）；cast 增 seq（客户端防重放）；welcome 增 modeRegistryVersion；snapshot 增 abilities（能力冷却权威回写）。players[uid] 实体自带 res 字段（资源权威回写，序列化即包含）。位移沿用 input{dx,dy}，不新增 move。world_* 消息字段不变（world.lua 运行时协议独立协商）。",
  "messages": [
    {
      "t": "input",
      "dir": "c2s",
      "opcode": 1,
      "fields": [
        {
          "name": "dx",
          "type": "float"
        },
        {
          "name": "dy",
          "type": "float"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "cast",
      "dir": "c2s",
      "opcode": 1,
      "fields": [
        {
          "name": "ability",
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "name": "target",
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "name": "seq",
          "type": "int"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "welcome",
      "dir": "s2c",
      "opcode": 1,
      "fields": [
        {
          "name": "id",
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "name": "mode",
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "name": "tick",
          "type": "int"
        },
        {
          "name": "proto",
          "type": "int"
        },
        {
          "name": "arena",
          "type": "object"
        },
        {
          "name": "modeRegistryVersion",
          "type": "int"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
